<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The block method in REACH CAD is a systematic approach to pattern drafting, utilizing foundational blocks as templates to create consistent and accurate garment patterns. These blocks serve as reusable base patterns, streamlining design, ensuring uniformity, and facilitating efficient modifications. This guide details the workflow for using the block method in the Pattern Designing and Grading System \(PDS\) module, based on the official REACH CAD user manual and industry best practices. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
